.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
This is a test document for the scdoc man page generator.\&
.PP
It is written for the Packit core repository scdoc test script.\&
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Show help information.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
.RS 4
Show version information.\&
.PP
.RE
\fB\-o\fR <file>
.RS 4
Write output to \fIfile\fR.\&
.PP
.RE
.SH INTERESTING STORY
.PP
This test file was created by some extraterrestrial being far away
